# .cursorrules — Cursor project rules for financial-scraper
#
# Single source of truth: AGENTS.md. This file is a thin pointer for
# Cursor. Do not duplicate rules here — they will drift from AGENTS.md.

Read AGENTS.md first and follow it as the authoritative guide.

Project: Python library scraping Brazilian financial sites into CSVs.
Python 3.10+, Poetry, pytest.

If you add Cursor-only affordances (e.g., `.cursor/rules/*.md` includes
or exclusions), put them here. Repo-wide rules belong in AGENTS.md.